{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0052_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7b38268b4843081ad16d368c2c2838cfbed30623c2900289a876542356761c45", "ja": "うわ、やっぱり風邪とかひいたんじゃ！？\nとりあえず、早く暖かいところに行きましょう！", "zh": "哇，果然还是感冒了吧！？\n总之我们快点去暖和的地方吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
